                  <p>Our guide to <a href="/blog/second-opinion-pancreatic-cancer-diagnosis-india">preparing for a pancreatic cancer second opinion</a> follows the same principles and may help you organize your records.</p>

                  <h2>Questions to Ask About Stage 3 Stomach Cancer Treatment Options</h2>
                  <ul>
                    <li>Do you agree with my stage, and has a staging laparoscopy been done or planned?</li>
                    <li>Should I receive chemotherapy before surgery, and which regimen?</li>
