                  <h2>Nutrition and Recovery After Gastrectomy</h2>
                  <p>After a gastrectomy, patients eat smaller, more frequent meals, gradually rebuild strength and need long-term monitoring of vitamin B12, iron and calcium. Planning nutrition before and after surgery makes a real difference to recovery and to completing chemotherapy; our guide on <a href="/blog/best-food-and-supplements-for-cancer-patients-during-treatment">food and supplements for cancer patients during treatment</a> offers practical advice.</p>

                  <h2>Where to Get a Second Opinion for Stage 3 Stomach Cancer in Hyderabad</h2>
